## PH7 total-substitution (neutral-inclusive) F: human k = mu = 38.4 per haploid genome per generation
  G 1322 (MITTENS 3.0 total): F per generation 50,765; per year 20 y 1.047, 25 y 0.837, 29 y 0.722
  G 1587 (2nd ed. total): F per generation 60,941; per year 20 y 1.256, 25 y 1.005, 29 y 0.866
  (1,408 and 2,887 are adaptive-only and not the like-for-like denominator for a total rate.)
  sensitivity: F = 1 per generation would need a human total substitution rate <= 1/1,322 = 7.56e-04 per haploid genome per generation, i.e. a neutral rate 50,765x below mu.

